(text "VCAP3 is internally above AVDD (~AVDD + 1.9 V).\nUse >=10 V rating; BOM standard is 16 V.\nVCAP1 includes 22 uF + 100 nF (TI Fig.106).\nUnused analogue pins 1-4,17,18,62 -> AVDD.\n27/29 NC; 60 open only with internal RLDREF selected.\nCLK pulldown: keep CLK_EN=0, CLKSEL=1." (at 205 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "129dcac0-58ed-54d2-8c0e-cfe50f344ce9"))
